{"case_id":"TC003","condition":"full","as_of_datetime":"2026-12-20T11:00:00+08:00","scenario":"birthday_festive_greetings","direction":"CA主动触达","trigger":"year_end_greeting","task_goal":"Send a restrained year-end greeting respecting contact preferences.","client_information":{"client_id":"C07","identity":{"name":"陆嘉仪","birth_date":"1975-08-21","city":"上海","age":51},"relationship":{"since":"2017-09-16","advisor_id":"CA002","preferred_channel":"wechat","alternative_channel":"phone"},"purchase_history":{"record_status":"available","transactions":[{"transaction_id":"TR-C07-001","date":"2022-03-19","sku":"LX-BG-201","product_name":"深棕色手提包","amount_cny":19800},{"transaction_id":"TR-C07-002","date":"2023-11-04","sku":"LX-SC-112","product_name":"羊绒披肩","amount_cny":6200},{"transaction_id":"TR-C07-003","date":"2025-04-12","sku":"LX-BG-305","product_name":"酒红色皮革肩包","amount_cny":23600},{"transaction_id":"TR-C07-004","date":"2026-06-20","sku":"LX-SL-028","product_name":"丝质方巾","amount_cny":2400}]},"service_history":[],"crm_notes":[{"date":"2023-11-04","text":"陆女士选披肩时对羊绒手感和颜色看得比较仔细，试了三种颜色后选了深灰色。"},{"date":"2025-04-12","text":"客户问过酒红色皮革的养护方式，也比较了同系列两个不同尺寸。"},{"date":"2026-06-20","text":"客户表示新品信息可以微信发，但不需要每次上新都通知，有特别的颜色或工艺再联系。"}]},"conversation_history":[{"message_id":"MSG-C07-001","timestamp":"2023-11-04T13:20:00+08:00","sender":"client","text":"刚才试的披肩，深灰色和米色我还是有点犹豫。"},{"message_id":"MSG-C07-002","timestamp":"2023-11-04T13:25:00+08:00","sender":"advisor","text":"陆女士，我个人觉得深灰色很衬您今天的外套。不过米色会更柔和一些，两种都可以。"},{"message_id":"MSG-C07-003","timestamp":"2023-11-04T13:31:00+08:00","sender":"client","text":"嗯，深灰吧。米色我已经有差不多的了。"},{"message_id":"MSG-C07-004","timestamp":"2025-04-12T16:02:00+08:00","sender":"client","text":"今天看的酒红色那个包，小号和中号除了尺寸还有什么区别？"},{"message_id":"MSG-C07-005","timestamp":"2025-04-12T16:08:00+08:00","sender":"advisor","text":"主要还是容量和上身比例不同。中号会更适合放日常物品，小号看起来精致一些。我把具体尺寸和细节图一起发您，您可以再对比。"},{"message_id":"MSG-C07-006","timestamp":"2025-04-12T16:12:00+08:00","sender":"client","text":"好。颜色我挺喜欢的，不是特别亮的红。"},{"message_id":"MSG-C07-007","timestamp":"2025-06-03T10:24:00+08:00","sender":"client","text":"酒红色那个包如果暂时不背，存放的时候需要特别注意什么？"},{"message_id":"MSG-C07-008","timestamp":"2025-06-03T10:33:00+08:00","sender":"advisor","text":"建议放在防尘袋里，避免长时间受压，也不要放在潮湿或者阳光直射的地方。我把官方护理说明发您，里面有比较详细的存放建议。"},{"message_id":"MSG-C07-009","timestamp":"2025-06-03T11:06:00+08:00","sender":"client","text":"收到，谢谢。"},{"message_id":"MSG-C07-010","timestamp":"2026-02-18T15:10:00+08:00","sender":"advisor","text":"陆女士，最近有几款新到的皮具，您有兴趣看看吗？"},{"message_id":"MSG-C07-011","timestamp":"2026-02-18T19:22:00+08:00","sender":"client","text":"最近先不用了，手上的包还没怎么轮换过来。"},{"message_id":"MSG-C07-012","timestamp":"2026-02-18T19:28:00+08:00","sender":"advisor","text":"好的。"},{"message_id":"MSG-C07-013","timestamp":"2026-06-20T17:14:00+08:00","sender":"client","text":"今天那条方巾颜色还挺特别的。"},{"message_id":"MSG-C07-014","timestamp":"2026-06-20T17:19:00+08:00","sender":"advisor","text":"是的，这次的配色比较少见，和之前几季的风格不太一样。"},{"message_id":"MSG-C07-015","timestamp":"2026-06-20T17:22:00+08:00","sender":"client","text":"以后有这种特别一点的颜色或者工艺可以告诉我。"},{"message_id":"MSG-C07-016","timestamp":"2026-06-20T17:23:00+08:00","sender":"client","text":"但不用每次上新都发哈，我平时消息太多。"},{"message_id":"MSG-C07-017","timestamp":"2026-06-20T17:30:00+08:00","sender":"advisor","text":"明白的陆女士。我会先帮您筛选，像比较特别的配色、工艺细节或者您之前关注过的系列，有合适的再联系您。其他常规上新就不打扰了。"},{"message_id":"MSG-C07-018","timestamp":"2026-06-20T17:35:00+08:00","sender":"client","text":"嗯，这样就好。"}],"current_client_message":null,"product_information":[],"event_information":[],"comparison_evidence":[],"policy":{"historical_paid_amount_is_not_current_list_price":true,"availability_unknown_by_default":true,"synthetic_verification_is_not_real_world_verification":true,"competitor_claims_require_external_evidence":true,"cost_and_durability_inferences_not_supported":true,"missing_value_semantics":"null=unknown_or_not_applicable; inspect field context","routine_CA_service_assistance_allowed":true,"service_entitlement_does_not_limit_assistance":true},"warnings":["Service opened before cutoff but latest snapshot is later; omitted to prevent future leakage."],"source_case_id":"S1-002"}
